{"job_id":"F-93d1ab41cdcb286aaabe","family_id":"F-93d1ab41cdcb286aaabe","title":"예산회계에관한특례법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"e33b0ed7b27dbfe54ce0311fa842581dc94106e3fa82192a6ee862ff5beebe9a","source_hash":"d086befca39494e5327bf5e9f5cffaeb31bfd352c6231bd90ca384ca78082a0d","text":"预算与会计特别法案"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":73,"target_id":"6be391dc4984b7949f043a1727ed0fac0049cce9ca4f204a0683e93ffd54b289","source_hash":"6ed6f38639d6b70bf512170a6207d8ec03ef7119ac9ef261b2d29debca20110f","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过规定有关预算和结算的特别程序，确保国家安全事务的有效执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":73,"end":219,"target_id":"b15d68ea3c9bc6e20279eabdfef5397e39b37c28503a1b4af2a26b6f22f983bf","source_hash":"d1367fbca7241ad3b9b9e1d85e3073a2e0fd446e0e09c3b4066e6ab165d8761a","text":"第二条（储备基金）尽管《国家财政法》另有规定，但用于国家安全活动的储备基金的使用和结算应当一次性完成，并由计划和预算部管辖。<1997年12月13日；1999年5月24日；2006年10月4日；2008年2月29日；2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":219,"end":277,"target_id":"feec5377d683460e3c0af3cdf315a7c58edab29db752f3ab890aac8123b83fe6","source_hash":"6efd09d3f17e96df2461fc4fa9742bb9c9c623758e13ed28fc6f66e76e3a36f7","text":"第三条（实施细则） 为实施本法，由总统令规定。<1997年12月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":277,"end":390,"target_id":"71cc4b1ee1efcc401c8957dd97022af938fb998d7f950da1a0e736b5afb5e84a","source_hash":"21041984ef794b0a74376ef5c73551657244b183a80fcecc8a1e57d222f9de97","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 1349，1963 年 5 月 31 日>\n\n①本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②本法实施前因国家安全活动而紧急且不可避免地动用储备基金的支出，应当按照第二条的规定予以结算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":390,"end":475,"target_id":"f9761ecf54b3248921e3c6977c319ab5c5b5d15bf782894321b3dfda7b1e29c0","source_hash":"30bd045b780ee749c8bd4e76ed0057c436e68002ac5c7c7647a54f11069d98d9","text":"补充规定（关于根据政府部门名称等变更修订建筑法等的法案）<1997年12月13日第5454号法案>\n\n本法自1998年1月1日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":475,"end":505,"target_id":"408b536d165ba47104c14da4afa9c1804c40eb0977cac4a17e70b69caf138995","source_hash":"c0381c4ec7dce2145b7da8f800ea5f1e64bb8984bd6f1f2c15377d726d23284c","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第5982号法令，1999年5月24日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":505,"end":543,"target_id":"34cbc6ab5d05568fecdbbcd562a173486db162a10f14df46715c37f26bf1484d","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":543,"end":551,"target_id":"c229239144999814b5a5e2e2bcc282cfa54c50cdfe8ca2901b17798b1dc1e21b","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":551,"end":654,"target_id":"5dd899b4302471a7d6cb2ff05cfa2798d34e2797ab6c4ca8e1838dd327d870d4","source_hash":"55a7aa9a3b261217ed1d284d4f90b7cc783aa90eee2590b6473eaf00b4b4eeb7","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至② 已省略\n\n  ③ 《预算会计特别案件法》修改如下。\n\n  第 2 条中的“在财政经济部管辖下”应改为“在计划预算部管辖下”。\n\n  ④ 至 <78> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":654,"end":668,"target_id":"34a24cef968014ac15d8bb4be2ec71427350cbbfd663ce4b6b80aa4fae6674f7","source_hash":"154ac8c7c18549bfaaa3137237c8e4de6690bd23ae0ff588fc17685c46363acd","text":"省略第 4 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":668,"end":1089,"target_id":"9bceff30d1734c6a149a8e336f78fce0e06fbb0730f428c935b1061c6ad5a5bc","source_hash":"dd660745f171173ee8c78e32a32fe4393c028ebc4159b6a312e6196c99c6bb3d","text":"第六条（机构撤销和设立后与其他法律法规的关系）  本法实施时其他法律法规中提及的计划预算委员会或预算机构，均指计划预算部；提及的计划预算委员会主席或预算机构负责人，均指计划预算部长；提及的计划预算委员会或预算机构的官员，均指计划预算部的官员；提及的公共信息办公室或海外推广的，均指政府信息办公室；提及的公共信息办公室主任或文化旅游部长，均指政府信息办公室主任；提及的公共信息办公室或文化旅游部的官员，均指政府信息办公室的官员。凡涉及文化财产的，凡涉及文化遗产管理局的，均指文化遗产管理局；凡涉及文化和旅游部长或文化遗产管理局局长的，均指文化遗产管理局局长；凡涉及文化和旅游部或文化遗产管理局的，均指文化遗产管理局的官员。参见\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1089,"end":1119,"target_id":"3615c9c1f07c024a7ddb36ce7810aefbe73ca485da2f36a4db026b57cade13fe","source_hash":"c7b08ddbb50d35f314f000dcc15e723f716835bc00ac0ee15fcd7037681c8db8","text":"附录（国家财政法）<第8050号法案，2006年10月4日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1119,"end":1163,"target_id":"a0d6d60b39cc734806eb73f14b2e1f7416a7d677dd130496849932ca3ddff7e3","source_hash":"9a080aee2d40b9c15e2df043b62f9f6684b6162aa1d256406c439e12d4f4e1e2","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2007年1月1日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1163,"end":1179,"target_id":"7dbe22cb262cc20238d912d2f3af4e72e168c0a7ed742100fb43e41990be72a8","source_hash":"2890a4d1696f46e3e839c6614b66d45729b822548e83c72184c6f767a19e6121","text":"省略第 2 至 10 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1179,"end":1243,"target_id":"da7a1fac67a230bf4838e44e0faa00dfa673a3c9c07885f4388456f777f78241","source_hash":"d200bda4807876918b711883f415a787d72bac69a8eec4d8f07dc6cedcef917f","text":"第11条（其他法律的修正）①至<41> 已省略\n\n  <42> 《预算会计特别案件法》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1243,"end":1294,"target_id":"692f4d66f6fa4636a7a048c3bbbe006a92f7a4267e7e21e259e39846a12fba57","source_hash":"c973cd10005fbd5f8891c1b2fdafb099b688eb40984fe71613e643a41f71cca4","text":"  第 2 条中的“预算和会计法”应改为“国家财政法”。\n\n  <43>至<59>已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1294,"end":1303,"target_id":"fe39233d00dbb11056e17b52772e5b8e2ae3da6140e25d0680ccf030998af09d","source_hash":"b719e8cab1326e600ed00a606371b4864921b5493377df1cd51685f485501fc1","text":"第 12 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1303,"end":1333,"target_id":"fe2737b5ca606b1a1cc746b2c8df525663e9d4580927304c02a889291f6b96b4","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1333,"end":1466,"target_id":"90d0ab9a0dc319818cd4f1a5a2245c6021008c036523f1ced81c56fac89b0d6e","source_hash":"521d8e5ab1ea8ad1965b0fa0941c6967f3b0e929ccafe8637d1746922053d134","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1466,"end":1483,"target_id":"50ada0377ae4375ed858722b691feb3051c7bcc1e12fea1125d59b36eae8ac5d","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1483,"end":1554,"target_id":"c3da344e93aea0b10cb3d48215f59a6d04be62c867665b4e497e1b73d40846ae","source_hash":"ba09c22da396b5ea44a1c92adb2d2ac785b1fb3eda7d1f173b1e0f779126582a","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<700> 已省略\n\n  《预算和会计特别案件法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1554,"end":1609,"target_id":"6e6ba3fddaa2ad254ef7e1c790729abc4d9fe537b09168e28e4ced15a2609fa8","source_hash":"e1021e40851200bf1613ba41cf4ac22c4c377ae888089d999700ab8c43d944b7","text":"  第 2 条中的“计划和预算部”应改为“战略和财政部”。\n\n  <702> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1609,"end":1617,"target_id":"a0bd3724b1f058045aba71941110c95c90fdc944e1dfb7acab51e3524123f388","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1617,"end":1648,"target_id":"5e3fb0c33aa8d782f1a03f84838ab9a4b4c6187f72c0af8c2fdaeeba4ddb0247","source_hash":"3480e86a86ef9ad8c919b6a09b870d318b15d3a9f68ecd56d35864dbf3fed08b","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第21065号法案，2025年10月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1648,"end":2169,"target_id":"26b83aeb0026a4c93a7888c40e7bdf4237acb2bcab9d4ebe478a7f6c40302700","source_hash":"5e8ac6ebc080703d90da77b6da219a55c5f1dfb62aa43590097cb9432c27cf97","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第七条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未届满的法律的条款，自相关法律的生效日期起生效；下列各款修正后的规定，自各款所定日期起生效。\n\n  1.下列各款的修正规定自2026年1月2日起生效。但是，根据附录第7条修正的法律（仅限于与第(a)款和第(b)款修正规定相关的部分），修正在正文生效日期之前颁布但尚未生效的法律的部分，应自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n    A. 修改第十九条第四款、第二十三条、第二十九条第一款第一项和第三十条的规定\n\n    B. 修改第 12 条第 2 款、第 19 条第 3 款、第 22 条以及第 29 条第 2 款但书的规定（仅限于有关财政经济大臣和财政经济部的部分）\n\n    C. 根据附录第7条修正的法案（仅限于与A款和B款修正条款相关的部分）\n\n  2. 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2169,"end":2186,"target_id":"ff6716267cb073ae565992c9c3aaed3e33a0c5e379d2b90dffe6c6668e147a9e","source_hash":"bc6c318c350b2ff1aac4a31f65fcae9d049d5f2d9358ead70ed1a2e0bc93798c","text":"省略第 2 至 6 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2186,"end":2253,"target_id":"4108dfb9390771f5412d6a2b133c6299ab11b5205861fcad64b4a6cd36cdac39","source_hash":"dcdbfe02468a3a3695482652cb1c88a5c44a7e91a24a99e75339e59afcbb4124","text":"第七条（其他法律的修正）①至<42>款已省略\n\n  <43> 《预算和会计特别案件法》部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2253,"end":2311,"target_id":"0e41931228f64f3bd8075f6b569d89546a8c125eff6418e69c2f69e68528d178","source_hash":"2a4c86cf189a779e5f77bd66de074215521c017d708c07f90c5444c557a8faf3","text":"  第 2 条中的“受战略和财政部管辖”应改为“受计划和预算部管辖”。\n\n  <44> 至 <626> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000730-276135-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2311,"end":2317,"target_id":"413aa9ce22dd30c83f9b8f7b406d5b0d043c7b09dc84dc7e622be3e91a17db18","source_hash":"ce9e83eae4c8866b9806b56fe62a5bee313e7744a910c2dc81b0d251c1d9c745","text":"第8条省略"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":13,"target_id":"aebe1bcb1b271fa0be5d012004695466f82c0754091eb9bcc2e938b235a61168","source_hash":"8097ed60de1309aadef1152dc8d14355536f16f37ce4a4eef1541dd9928d56c5","text":"关于预算和会计特殊案件法的执行令"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":213,"target_id":"0d3e2f4a102e051682f9b94e191833ac627f5dbc964a411258d995d720db8a61","source_hash":"86a22b81634753051a46ab15d44419a1b80532f3f5a12928050188246e891029","text":"第一条（定义）《预算会计特别事项法》（以下简称“本法”）第二条规定的“国家安全活动所需储备资金”是指收集和处理与国家安全有关的重要国内外情报以及调查涉及国家安全的严重反国家犯罪所需的费用，以及根据国民议会决议确定的与加强被列为重大秘密的军事设施和装备相关的费用。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":213,"end":297,"target_id":"aec5c2779ec7667d7319ae22fce1810b0feb8ae85d738a4196ee6db55b4711ec","source_hash":"1ccd4c6d551dc86f2cfe3302fb8d38086a71571c584355488d2683aa8b628f40","text":"第二条（动用储备金的申请） 按照本法第二条规定，动用储备金的申请中，不须说明总额的估算依据，而应当说明其用途为储备金。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":297,"end":423,"target_id":"d2251718bb7157b889b448e1cfb58f03b64d2f34038132f64058944e716ccb6c","source_hash":"ca3042975b726b5b7e8c5ab13ee2584e5baf818e89243e9ffb24b8ef50e6583c","text":"第三条（储备金的分配）计划预算部长应当按照前条规定分配储备金，无需进行分类或细分。<1994年12月23日、1998年2月28日、1999年5月24日、2008年2月29日、2025年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":423,"end":570,"target_id":"549206d8a44924e161dd07c321111998b26c50d9089cee816442469e7fba7cf2","source_hash":"0b81a107bbfe7acdd98eb0035c3aa4eea8f7eb9a98f3b8f9ad59230765f3f563","text":"第四条（支出）计划和预算部长根据前条规定拨付储备金时，应当根据支出单位负责人的请求一次性拨付。<1994年12月23日、1998年2月28日、1999年5月24日、2008年2月29日、2025年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":570,"end":631,"target_id":"3ccb70acdf705e4524399897fd50aa14062f05ac1760fdffb969cd34b7b067a3","source_hash":"759b02aa56b8464d0e110abeecf25ca0ff916ade0bcf5f673b1d12902479fbe7","text":"第五条（储备金支出使用情况说明）按照前条规定拨付的储备金支出使用情况说明，只应列明拨付总额。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":631,"end":676,"target_id":"6cdc1b0c94e23d31313ecf6650dd33adaa36ced673581ddf3c0ab9de43a89757","source_hash":"df55a858ebb500b43269745738960ed4edda7c0bc2a313591335659e2f99a640","text":"补充条款 <第4180号，1969年10月27日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":676,"end":721,"target_id":"8e2b800dbdfdc4681e1f8ced89edd5d87108f4086dbe9ee8826ed325e30652a6","source_hash":"318aace68271da261c6ec2e57a663e30aa73c0242528bf7cc60ab0bdf4ddd647","text":"补充规定 <第7397号，1974年11月23日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":721,"end":761,"target_id":"3e24a28378c35f56aa34f40212e64878062df23805966c94ad7347ab37981026","source_hash":"f070c16dfc8fdaeb519c12bce09b89fce757a05e0a193af89b4dd87f8385b18f","text":"增编（财政经济部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1994年12月23日第14438号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":761,"end":791,"target_id":"64de82150f1f78d9cc04f4bb8667134979ec62f5516d10e6d033bdfdd5ce0f04","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":791,"end":806,"target_id":"b959d4b845dc837a300211e8ecfc9988823284514b9ab66e8fd4d1b9c9aa447a","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":806,"end":869,"target_id":"91fb7eac1a02b4f313f8d044ff7eb0f33eb395baf2791738b389134381b38c1e","source_hash":"4094eeb498784e68f5224e360449586f98f284a4798ae85b364aef98f2a59828","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<31> 已省略\n\n  <32> 《预算和会计特别案件法》实施细则修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":869,"end":931,"target_id":"503692cb1159c83fab5a87753dd2a11e423e62420c89480509ea834957d13bdc","source_hash":"9d1876fc106ff753812949dcaea00d094a744fd0f8def8aa6122766a022f2e21","text":"  第 3 条和第 4 条中的“经济计划委员会部长”应改为“财政经济部长”。\n\n  <33>至<327>省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":931,"end":970,"target_id":"d7556e3c32ddf73c692d7a56a0520746bca14ff168539e5813ef39e4b5a5f432","source_hash":"a6a9e1b2de7ae93fb9c7934939dccede6c31102f71076602db8c5ab459b0c9cb","text":"增编（财政经济部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1998年2月28日第15703号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":970,"end":1000,"target_id":"13d97b4172e8b6bd53c14ec9a06b140ce24065abe3671e12662f5b2dc03d237b","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1000,"end":1015,"target_id":"7a2b0f322c86e0b796a53cb4d3d30753da621ebe33dcd947528875db5a169ab7","source_hash":"5a59a79dd14cf60a8856d88c6eeec15a3bcd860d4b2df98e6a6f94e4ec6af028","text":"省略第 2 至 6 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1015,"end":1071,"target_id":"39e17725d64cec54fe15b93704bca7d0bd21bcb48de67e735f102b73d8721b12","source_hash":"b78c6c80136638dee1d7ab0494bd4fe704827a7ac7cf988aa086f64abd2dd0dd","text":"第七条（修改其他法律）①和② 已省略\n\n  ③ 《预算会计特别案件法》实施细则修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1071,"end":1123,"target_id":"cf713907f7c763f8538293afb1fc80fe7dc2ecc90f4f174c7003cba9fd87cddc","source_hash":"6645c5b359b61ee87038e8cbc28bf2568e8ae7a628276fdf4e69be5e99891f01","text":"  第 3 条和第 4 条中的“财政经济部长”应改为“预算办公室主任”。\n\n  ④ 至 ⑩ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1123,"end":1156,"target_id":"b2c82a6a79b2d1abfd2507117c7e7a37c6720a8bfca7b7af13fce10ea992d2d9","source_hash":"d109bb3f2e0d5b8976756855df0248ae0ffb3ef935e8bf58965673ddce5d8480","text":"增补（计划和预算部组织结构）<1999年5月24日，第16326号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1156,"end":1186,"target_id":"a853ce36c958a4f2c8682ea8ddb7c320618728ed06940c5abd1fad8b4cc18eb9","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1186,"end":1200,"target_id":"f2ea2d392ebebded6b8a4db72f941b0cfcdb505e7bebbbd4cf71cb4d1b4518b1","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1200,"end":1253,"target_id":"c0d91a9b83c8d6cd6b13cebf50b40b71fff415618da7cbd42a66b1ef4b711788","source_hash":"dfe3c2ed1dcce2793d6a48bc14958dc998e70f7a6148dae643831d05de937749","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 对有关预算和会计特别案件的法律实施细则修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1253,"end":1309,"target_id":"2cbad78626df0b585373e73c55e7725fb486feb8b3ed1804ab75fbcee1a73980","source_hash":"bfaca809e33133eb9c06b88e31ede53e2bc92fc3002e9594c38212050a4af9d3","text":"  第 3 条和第 4 条中的“预算办公室专员”应改为“计划和预算部长”。\n\n  ③ 至 <109> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1309,"end":1351,"target_id":"3bf206e2a8d5a71c1dc99f5ae2ecfebb4d8d6a661eec4a57661c2a2aaa13153e","source_hash":"21f4470ea24a142edd3c15eaab36da06d3b27672c68d9c9cb075dac1cb2b7436","text":"增编（战略财政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20720号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1351,"end":1477,"target_id":"2c66faad1a8788f8b761cf0f1c77ce6d720b84013f60fc2f5b339e63a34082d2","source_hash":"f678e1f77ab876b6f1f733f842660197cdc7fa1a1e2df51a1b0d194423447bbe","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1477,"end":1494,"target_id":"c47a867444fe6e72bda1683b1d5590b068e5c99ad20311d2d6fd076c2a49e287","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第2至7条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00027","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1494,"end":1631,"target_id":"3919bb3646b298da564e6b6a0bf2b3561f099f37c2bf6cabd25ba82afbdc86f6","source_hash":"fb84c49fb043c71b77db5eb6955d6f52787ba0e10c5d9c38bf74c85ee4d399d2","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至<48> 已省略\n\n  《预算会计特别案件法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第 3 条和第 4 条中的“计划和预算部长”应改为“战略和财政部长”。\n\n  <49> 至 <68> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00028","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1631,"end":1674,"target_id":"ec4498904e603bdec97d30fd338bf3ab69625f8ff2974f668f8e7e06b541f3c6","source_hash":"e94cb060215343794849c45723917db1ef36905da0729360d1209f1fd79739ab","text":"增编（计划和预算部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第35948号，2025年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00029","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1674,"end":1804,"target_id":"e9b0383cc0052442971d0bd21f2cdd939ddf4694ccef7583f7021cd4f7fd9281","source_hash":"d91ca08ab13d680b646c74aa4763cd8612c6e937853e3db26fe10f30e26d8871","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2026年1月2日起生效。但是，根据本补充法令第四条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前颁布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00030","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1804,"end":1818,"target_id":"914b6a1ba5e86f26a376a0e1e2b4a059ccf297a8a320f8c8d53a78a63e15cfe7","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00031","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1818,"end":1881,"target_id":"338d4390fdbe0641fc85a352de8fd73967a70edd181d815bfcdf53b77c13a8af","source_hash":"2af9763505e72ee01692e9d79fd92606905dff832d8d98f4fb2e5761b6797c48","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至④ 省略\n\n  ⑤ 《预算会计特别案件法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004231-281415-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1881,"end":1942,"target_id":"5aace2b326b1f866f868e2da67871eabfadaee4e800baf4a40b2716dee1e960f","source_hash":"484c17048580c47cd5568c3748a25ffb69ae9fd5859892a822e7af61c5170fef","text":"  第 3 条和第 4 条中的“战略和财政部长”应改为“计划和预算部长”。\n\n  省略⑥至<176>"}]}